      "message": "-march\u003dgoldmont is better than -march\u003dsilvermont because it allows the comipler to use more CPU instructions.\nPlease see https://gcc.gnu.org/onlinedocs/gcc/x86-Options.html for details.\n\nAs described in b/259201836 we\u0027re planning to use goldmont for Android U or later running on ChromeOS. I\u0027ve included the other two (i.e. goldmont-plus and tremont) in this CL to cover all Atom CPU types which ChromeOS may use in future.\n\nIf you think it\u0027s better to avoid adding goldmont-plus and tremont now, I\u0027ll drop them from this CL.\nPlease let me know your preference.",
